
Returns the result of query: ASSOCIATORS OF {<wmi object>}.
USAGE:

ASSOC[:<format specifier>] [<assoc switches>]
NOTE: <format specifier> ::= (<xsl file name> |  KEYWORD)

The following ASSOC switches are available:

/RESULTCLASS:<classname>    - Indicates that the returned endpoints associated with the source object must belong to or be derived from the specified class.
/RESULTROLE:<rolename>      - Indicates that the returned endpoints must play a particular role in their association with the source object.
/ASSOCCLASS:<assocclass>    - Indicates that the returned endpoints must be associated with the source through the specified class or one of its derived classes.

